        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin ADI-RAR, Adirondack Handleset with Arched Interior Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Adirondack Entryset has a rustic appearance that is quickly becoming very popular in the world of home decor. This handleset has a covered deadbolt. It is available in either a dark bronze (pictured) or a white bronze finish. The Adirondack Handleset will fit standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors with 1-3/4 inch - 2-1/2 inch thicknesses. The adjustable latch allows it to fit 2-3/8 inch backsets as well as 2-3/4 inch backsets. A grade 2 lock, it is backed by a lifetime warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Bronze Adirondack Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection Adirondack Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Length: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length (without deadbolt): 12-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length center to center (without deadbolt): 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Adirondack Entryset with Rustic Arched Rose, Baldwin ADI-RAR",
                "description": "Baldwin ADI-RAR, Adirondack Entryset  - The Adirondack Entryset has a rustic appearance that is quickly becoming very popular in the world of home decor. It is available in either a dark bronze or a white bronze finish. The Adirondack Handleset will fit standard 2-1/8 inch pre-drilled doors with 1-3/4 inch - 2-1/2 inch thicknesses. The adjustable latch allows it to fit 2-3/8 inch backsets as well as 2-3/4 inch backsets. A grade 2 lock, it is backed by a lifetime warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions.",
                "keywords": "covered deadbolt handlesets, traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, BAL-ADI-RAR, Baldwin Rustic Collection Adirondack Entrysets, Adirondack Entryset with Rustic Arched Roses, Adirondack Handleset with Arched Interior Roses, Bronze Adirondack Entrance Sets, Baldwin Reserve Collection Adirondack Handlesets, covered deadbolt handlesets"
